# Call the Gatekeeper to perform title/abstract screening using the protocol criteria.                                  
gatekeeper_task = f"""                                                                                                  
You are performing title/abstract screening only for the following systematic review.                                   
                                                                                                                        
Review title:                                                                                                           
{review_title}                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                        
Selection criteria (verbatim; apply only these, do not add new criteria):                                               
{selection_criteria}                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                        
Population: depressed people aged 6 to 18 years.                                                                        
Intervention: orally administered tricyclic drugs.                                                                      
Comparator: placebo.                                                                                                    
Design: randomised controlled trials.                                                                                   
Setting: any.                                                                                                           
Outcome: efficacy (per RCT vs placebo).                                                                                 
                                                                                                                        
Instructions:                                                                                                           
- Screen ONLY on title/abstract information.                                                                            
- Use decisions: INCLUDE or EXCLUDE.                                                                                    
  - INCLUDE if the title/abstract suggests the study meets the criteria or if eligibility cannot be confidently ruled   
out from the abstract alone.                                                                                            
  - EXCLUDE if the title/abstract clearly does not meet the criteria (e.g., non-RCT, not tricyclic, not oral            
administration, outside 6–18 years, no placebo comparator, not depression).                                             
- Provide exactly one decision object per candidate study.                                                              
- Return your output in the standard screening schema expected by this pipeline (one decision per study), not a         
narrative summary.                                                                                                      
- Do not group or merge studies; do not omit any study.                                                                 
                                                                                                                        
There are exactly {expected_n_studies} candidate studies in the provided candidates_json. Your output must contain      
exactly {expected_n_studies} individual decisions.                                                                      
"""                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                        
gatekeeper_response = gatekeeper(                                                                                       
    task=gatekeeper_task,                                                                                               
    additional_args={                                                                                                   
        "candidates_json": candidates_json                                                                              
    }                                                                                                                   
)                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                        
# Print a short confirmation for logs                                                                                   
print("Gatekeeper response received. Length:", len(gatekeeper_response))                                                
                                                                                                                        
# Save the screening evidence; this will fail closed if the decision count != expected_n_studies.                       
save_path = save_screening_evidence_json(                                                                               
    screening_response=gatekeeper_response,                                                                             
    output_dir=output_dir,                                                                                              
    expected_n_studies=expected_n_studies                                                                               
)                                                                                                                       
print("Evidence saved to:", save_path)                                                                                  
                                                                                                                        
# Build and return a concise screening summary                                                                          
summary = format_screening_summary(                                                                                     
    review_title=review_title,                                                                                          
    screening_response=gatekeeper_response                                                                              
)                                                                                                                       
final_answer(summary)                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                        
