│ AMT or placebo; 2 Ss responded to placebo only. It is concluded that AMT may have a useful place in the treatment of │
│ childhood depression.(19 ref)(PsycINFO Database Record (c) 2016 APA, all rights reserved)American Psychological      │
│ Association"}, {"study_index": 7, "title": "Newer generation antidepressants for depressive disorders in children    │
