│ of depressive disorders in children and adolescents.cochranelibrary.com"}, {"study_index": 8, "title": "Imipramine   │
│ plus cognitive‐behavioural therapy in the treatment of school refusal", "abstract": "OBJECTIVE To investigate the    │
