- Intervention: orally administered tricyclic antidepressants (TCAs)                                                    
- Comparator: placebo                                                                                                   
- Design: randomized controlled trial (double-blind acceptable)                                                         
- Outcome: efficacy (i.e., clinical improvement vs placebo)                                                             
                                                                                                                        
